Kernel patches: shared PE12/PE13 HW I2C + GPIO SMI on `&i2c2`.

Included in production `tp2bmc_defconfig` (`BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_PATCH`).
Device tree: `sun8i-t113s-turing-pi2.dtsi` (`tpi-i2c-smi-arb` + `switch@smi`).

Former patches 0004–0006 (defer GPIO at probe, I²C platform device not `i2c-0`,
empty `smi_mode` pinctrl + per-xfer GPIO / `pm_runtime_suspend`) are folded
into **0002**.

| Patch | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| 0001 | DT binding `turing,i2c-smi-arbiter` |
| 0002 | `tpi-i2c-smi-arbiter` driver + Kconfig (shared-pin probe, pinctrl, pin release) |
| 0003 | `realtek-smi` bracket via `turing,smi-arbiter` |
